{"path":"/industries/fintech-ai/","slug":"industries__fintech-ai","kind":"industry","title":"Fintech Web Design & Marketing Agency | Legency Media","description":"Fintech marketing agency and Webflow Enterprise Partner. Websites, search and AI visibility for fintech and AI companies, with monthly reporting on enquiries.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/fintech-ai.BfDEDJli.css","/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/FaqSection.BU63QfoB.css","/_astro/ServiceLayout.DWPKQstD.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"svc-hero svc-hero--proof\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"svc-hero__tex\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/secondary-hero.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><div class=\"container svc-hero__inner\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Industries</span><h1 class=\"svc-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Fintech &amp; AI</h1><p class=\"svc-hero__sub\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>One day of performance work took Blueflame AI&#39;s mobile speed score from 36 to 72, and the site kept shipping through a funding round, an acquisition and a rebrand. We build and maintain Webflow sites for fintech and AI companies, with copy written for compliance review and monthly reporting on search, AI visibility and enquiries.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--blue\" href=\"/get-in-touch/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get in touch</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><p class=\"svc-hero__proof\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Blueflame AI: 18+ months of ongoing website support through acquisition and rebrand. <a href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Read the case study ↗</a></p></div></section><section class=\"section evo\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__head\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where Deals Are Lost</span><h2 class=\"evo__heading\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Where a Fintech Site Loses the Deal Before the Call</h2></div><div class=\"evo__grid\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Problem</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Standard Agency</span></div><div class=\"evo__cards\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M6 6L18 6\"/><path d=\"M6 10H18\"/><path d=\"M13 14L18 14\"/><path d=\"M13 18L18 18\"/><path d=\"M2 21.4V2.6C2 2.26863 2.26863 2 2.6 2H21.4C21.7314 2 22 2.26863 22 2.6V21.4C22 21.7314 21.7314 22 21.4 22H2.6C2.26863 22 2 21.7314 2 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 18V14H9V18H6Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Legal pulls the page back after launch</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Copy written without the regulated vocabulary in mind goes live, gets rewritten by compliance, and goes live again. The campaign window closes during the second pass, and the site ends up saying nothing at all.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 6L20 6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 5.79999L4.60002 6.59998L6.60001 4.59999\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 11.8L4.60002 12.6L6.60001 10.6\"/><path d=\"M3.80002 17.8L4.60002 18.6L6.60001 16.6\"/><path d=\"M9 12L20 12\"/><path d=\"M9 18L20 18\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The SOC 2 badge lands in the footer and stops</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>A prospect&#39;s risk function opens the site before the first call. If the badge sits in a footer with nothing around it, the reviewer cannot find what they were sent to check, and what they cannot find they assume is missing.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--light\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M15 4V2M15 4V6M15 4H10.5M3 10V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21H19C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V10H3Z\"/><path d=\"M3 10V6C3 4.89543 3.89543 4 5 4H7\"/><path d=\"M7 2V6\"/><path d=\"M21 10V6C21 4.89543 20.1046 4 19 4H18.5\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The site lags a quarter behind the roadmap</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Fintech and AI companies move on funding rounds and product launches. When every change waits in a queue, the site describes the company as it was last quarter, and the investor who searches for you before the call sees the old one.</p></article></div></div><div class=\"evo__col\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__colhead\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"evo__kicker\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Solution</span><span class=\"evo__coltitle evo__coltitle--brand\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><img src=\"/img/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" class=\"evo__logo\" width=\"57\" height=\"57\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The Legency Approach</span></span></div><div class=\"evo__cards evo__cards--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><div class=\"evo__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm></div><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Launches hold their date through compliance review</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Claims, disclosures and page copy are written for the review they will go through, so pages clear legal on the first pass and the campaign ships inside its window.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M14.2718 10.445L18 2M9.31612 10.6323L5 2M12.7615 10.0479L8.835 2M14.36 2L13.32 4.5M6 16C6 19.3137 8.68629 22 12 22C15.3137 22 18 19.3137 18 16C18 12.6863 15.3137 10 12 10C8.68629 10 6 12.6863 6 16Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Trust signals sit where institutional buyers look</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>SOC 2, ISO 27001, data residency and subprocessors on a page that exists before anyone asks. The reviewer finds what they came for, and the site says &quot;these people can handle our contract&quot;.</p></article><article class=\"evo-card evo-card--dark\" data-astro-cid-asdozulm><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--on-dark\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:38px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-asdozulm>The site keeps pace with the roadmap</h3><p data-astro-cid-asdozulm>Requests go into a shared channel and come back live inside an agreed turnaround, so a pricing change is up before the sales call and the launch page is live the day the announcement goes out.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section foundation\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div class=\"foundation__head\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><div data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Built for the Category</span><h2 class=\"foundation__heading\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Four Things a Fintech Engagement Delivers</h2></div></div><div class=\"foundation__grid\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Copy That Clears Legal First Time</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Claims, disclosures and page copy written for the review they will face, so launches stop waiting on a second pass.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Trust Signals a Reviewer Can Find</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>SOC 2, ISO 27001 and security posture placed where an enterprise or institutional buyer&#39;s risk team looks for them.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>A Site That Keeps Pace With Funding Rounds</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Changes requested in a shared channel and live inside an agreed turnaround, so the site always describes the company as it is now.</p></article><article class=\"found-card\" data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6><span class=\"icon-chip\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:48px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M18.5 15L5.5 15\"/><path d=\"M16 4L8 4\"/><path d=\"M9 4.5L9 10.2602C9 10.7376 8.82922 11.1992 8.51851 11.5617L3.48149 17.4383C3.17078 17.8008 3 18.2624 3 18.7398V19C3 20.1046 3.89543 21 5 21L19 21C20.1046 21 21 20.1046 21 19V18.7398C21 18.2624 20.8292 17.8008 20.5185 17.4383L15.4815 11.5617C15.1708 11.1992 15 10.7376 15 10.2602L15 4.5\"/><path d=\"M12 9.01L12.01 8.99889\"/><path d=\"M11 2.01L11.01 1.99889\"/></svg></span><h3 data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>Original Fintech Research</h3><p data-astro-cid-6q4o4ab6>The Fintech AI Visibility Index tracks how often fintech and AI brands are cited by AI assistants, so you know where you stand before a buyer asks one.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"section dp\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Compliance on the Page</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Regulated Buyers Read Your Site Looking for Reasons to Stop</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>In fintech the website is part of the diligence. A prospect's risk function will open it before the first call, and what they cannot find they assume is missing. Our <a href=\"/blog/how-to-choose-a-webflow-enterprise-agency/\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Webflow Enterprise agency selection checklist</a> sets out the evidence to request before appointing a build partner.</p></div><div class=\"container dp__cards\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><h3 data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Trust signals where they look</h3><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Certifications, data residency and subprocessors belong on a page that exists before anyone asks. Buried in a footer or held back for the sales deck, they do not help the person who was sent to check.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><h3 data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Claims that survive review</h3><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Regulated categories have language you cannot use and language you must. Copy written without that in mind gets rewritten by legal after launch, which is how sites end up saying nothing at all.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><h3 data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Page speed as a credibility signal</h3><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>A slow, heavy site reads as an unserious one to a buyer whose own product is judged on latency. It is a soft signal that a buyer acts on.</p></article><article class=\"dp__card\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><h3 data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Change control that exists</h3><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Knowing who changed what and when matters more here than in most sectors. A build with governance and a change record answers a question that will eventually be asked.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"section ans\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><div class=\"container dp__head\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Why AI Visibility Matters Here First</span><h2 class=\"dp__heading\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Fintech Buyers Ask an Assistant Before They Ask a Vendor</h2><p class=\"dp__sub\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Considered purchase, long research cycle, and a category where the buyer starts by asking what the options even are. That is the exact shape of question an AI assistant now answers with a shortlist.</p></div><div class=\"container ans__stats\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>18+</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>months retained, one monthly report format</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Blueflame AI, through a raise, an acquisition and a rebrand</span></article><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>36 to 72</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>mobile speed score after one day of work</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Blueflame AI, February 2026</span></article><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>91%</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>cut from the font payload</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Page weight halved, 2,458KB to 1,231KB</span></article><article class=\"ans__stat\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"ans__num\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>32 to 1</span><span class=\"ans__what\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>structured data errors between two crawls</span><span class=\"ans__src\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Blueflame AI, markup checked on a schedule</span></article></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><div class=\"ans__panel\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><div class=\"ans__engines\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>What the Panel Measures</span><h3 class=\"ans__panel-heading\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>The shortlist forms early</h3><ul class=\"ans__marks\" aria-label=\"AI engines checked\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><li data-astro-cid-kceueeek><img src=\"/img/engines/chatgpt.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek> ChatGPT</li><li data-astro-cid-kceueeek><img src=\"/img/engines/claude.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek> Claude</li><li data-astro-cid-kceueeek><img src=\"/img/engines/perplexity.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek> Perplexity</li><li data-astro-cid-kceueeek><img src=\"/img/engines/gemini.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek> Gemini</li></ul><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>When the assistant names three companies and yours is missing, the buyer's shortlist is set without you, and no feature comparison gets you back onto it.</p></div><div class=\"ans__how\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><div class=\"ans__how-item\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><h4 data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Being wrong is worse than being absent</h4><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Assistants describe companies from stale sources, so a fintech can be named for a product it retired or a market it left. Measuring what is said is the only way to find that.</p></div><div class=\"ans__how-item\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><h4 data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Competitors are already there</h4><p data-astro-cid-kceueeek>In every panel we have run, a competitor is already being cited on the category questions. The question is who is in those answers today, and the panel names them.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"caseband\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"pixelated-scroll-transition\" data-pixelated-scroll-transition data-columns=\"24\" data-columns-tablet=\"18\" data-columns-mobile=\"10\" data-rows=\"8\" data-mode=\"reveal\" style=\"color:var(--bg)\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"caseband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div><div class=\"container caseband__inner\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><div class=\"caseband__content\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Case Study</span><span class=\"caseband__chip\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" loading=\"lazy\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></span><h2 class=\"caseband__heading\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Through a funding round and an acquisition.</h2><p class=\"caseband__text\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f>Blueflame AI builds agentic AI for investment firms. It raised, was acquired by Datasite and rebranded onto a new domain during this engagement, and the site kept shipping on the same component system throughout, with a monthly evidence report in one unchanging format.</p><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>View Case Study</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a></div><div class=\"caseband__media\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f><img src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" alt=\"Blueflame’s new homepage and logo on an Apple Studio Display in a city office.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-od6mpv6f></div></div></section><section class=\"ctaband\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__scene\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-us-project-src=\"/scene/band-loop.json\" data-us-fps=\"60\" data-us-scale=\"1\" data-us-dpi=\"1.5\" data-us-lazyload=\"true\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz></div><div class=\"container ctaband__inner\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><div class=\"ctaband__text\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Start With What Buyers Are Told</span><h2 class=\"ctaband__heading\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Find Out What AI Assistants Say About You</h2><p class=\"ctaband__body\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Fintech buyers ask an assistant before they ask a vendor, and assistants describe companies from stale sources. A call about what that means for your category, and how the measurement works.</p></div><div class=\"ctaband__side\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><ul class=\"ctaband__points\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Four engines asked the category questions your buyers type</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>Whether you are named for products you still sell, or ones you retired</li><li data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>The trust signals a risk reviewer will look for, and whether they are findable</li></ul><div class=\"ctaband__actions\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz><a class=\"btn-bubble-arrow btn-bubble-arrow--white\" href=\"/schedule/\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh=\"true\"><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><span class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__content-text\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh>Get Your AI Visibility Read</span></div><div class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow is--duplicate\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"100%\" class=\"btn-bubble-arrow__arrow-svg\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh><polyline points=\"18 8 18 18 8 18\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></polyline><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"5\" y2=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" data-astro-cid-ekguhzzh></line></svg></div></a><a class=\"ctaband__quiet\" href=\"/aeo-agency/\" data-astro-cid-hwvj6ntz>How the measurement works</a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section faq\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__head\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Common Questions</span><h2 class=\"faq__heading\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Frequently Asked<br data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Questions</h2></div><div class=\"faq__list\" data-faq data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-0\" id=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Do you understand fintech compliance requirements?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-0\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-0\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes. Claims, disclosures and page copy are written for the legal and compliance review they will go through, so pages clear it on the first pass and launches hold their dates. Language a regulated category cannot use never reaches the draft.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-1\" id=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>How do you handle SOC 2 and security trust signals on the site?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-1\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-1\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>SOC 2, ISO 27001 and the rest of your security posture go on a page that exists before anyone asks, placed where a prospect&#39;s risk reviewer will look for them. The badge and the copy around it both carry evidence, so the person sent to check finds what they were sent for.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-2\" id=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Can you move fast for a funded, high-growth fintech team?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-2\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-2\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>Yes, inside an agreed process. Requests go into a shared channel with a committed turnaround: small changes the same working day, a new page from your components in days, larger work scoped and scheduled. The site keeps pace with a roadmap that moves on funding rounds and launches.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"faq__item\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><h2 class=\"faq__q\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay=\"true\"><button class=\"faq__btn\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-panel-3\" id=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><span class=\"faq__q-text\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>What is the Fintech AI Visibility Index?</span><span class=\"faq__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay></span></button></h2><div class=\"faq__panel\" id=\"faq-panel-3\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"faq-btn-3\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><div class=\"faq__panel-inner\" data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay><p data-astro-cid-kpn7xbay>It is original research we run, tracking how often fintech and AI brands are cited by AI assistants like ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude. Findings are published as they land, so a fintech marketing leader can see where the category stands before a buyer asks an assistant.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section research\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><div class=\"container research__inner\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>Original Research</span><h2 class=\"research__heading\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>The Fintech AI Visibility Index</h2><p class=\"research__text\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>We run the Fintech AI Visibility Index, original research tracking how often fintech and AI brands get cited when buyers ask AI assistants a question. It shows whether the assistants your buyers use are naming you, and who they name instead. Findings are published as they land on <a href=\"/ai-visibility-index/\" data-astro-cid-kceueeek>the AI Visibility Index</a>.</p></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".pixelated-scroll-transition{z-index:10;pointer-events:none;position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0}[data-pixelated-scroll-panel]{flex-direction:row;width:100%;display:flex}[data-pixelated-scroll-column]{flex-direction:column;flex:1;justify-content:flex-end;align-items:stretch;min-width:0;display:flex}[data-pixelated-scroll-pixel]{aspect-ratio:1;backface-visibility:hidden;will-change:opacity;background-color:currentColor;width:100%}[data-pixelated-scroll-transition][data-mode=reveal]{inset:0 0 auto}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.pixelated-scroll-transition{display:none}}\nhtml.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth ifram